Existence + owner/admin check first, exactly as bookings-get (404
'Booking not found', 403 'Access denied. You can only access your own
bookings.'); when authorization fails nothing is written
(business_rules[0]). The booking is read once and that one item serves
both purposes (SI-1).
Then one conditional write: status 'CONFIRMED' plus a freshly generated
bookingReference. The current status is not checked - a CANCELLED or
already CONFIRMED booking is confirmed too and simply gets a new random
reference (business_rules[2]/[4]). Nothing else happens: no seat, no
